Method: Greedy Algorithm
Time Complexity: O(n log n + amount)
Space Complexity: O(n)

Conclusion:
The Coin Change problem was solved using the Greedy Algorithm. 
The largest possible coin is selected at each step until the required amount is reached. 
This method is simple and efficient for standard coin denominations.
